2nd Question 
Team Formation 

The task was to form a team of size k from a given array by following below rules: 
a) You need to take two windows of size w from front and rear side of the array. 
b) Take the greatest score from the both windows and add it to the answer variable, at last delete the 
considered score from the array (so that it is not taken into consideration for next iteration). 

Solution: 
I used a max heap and added all the elements that were present in the window of size (w + k), from front and 
rear side of the array. 
Now I just needed to pop the max heap k times. 


int helper(vector<int> score, int k, int w) 
{ 
    int n = score.size(); 
    priority_queue<int> q; 
    int ans = 0; 
    for (int i = 0; i < k + w; i++) 
    { 
        if (i < n) 
        { 
            q.push(score[i]); 
        } 
    } 
    for (int i = n - k - w; i < n; i++) 
    { 
        // this condition is to prevent adding elements from the front window so that we don’t overlap 
        if (i >= k + w) 
        { 
            q.push(score[i]); 
        } 
    } 
    for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) 
    { 
        ans += q.top(); 
        q.pop(); 
    } 
    return ans; 
} 
